g_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159420/extras/05ff2b7d060ae1caef975bff37af6c09.poster.avif?t=1786619570\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159420/extras/05ff2b7d060ae1caef975bff37af6c09.webm?t=1786619570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159420/extras/05ff2b7d060ae1caef975bff37af6c09.mp4?t=1786619570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another important part of taking care of the settlement will be to manage the community members’ professions and tasks, training them to become craftsmen, hunters, or guards, and to manage the settlement’s resources, either gathering them yourself or stealing them from convoys and noble estates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Robin's people grow large in number and strong in sword arm, an uprising in Nottingham may just become a reality, ending the Sheriff's tyranny once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Robin Hood and his Merry Men survive and put an end to injustice? Their fate is up to you!</p>", "short_description": "Robin Hood - Sherwood Builders is an action-adventure RPG with base-building elements, where you take on the role of a classic hero who stands up to the tyranny and injustice that haunts Sherwood. Fight, craft, steal, and of course help the local people grow and prosper.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159420/header.jpg?t=1786619570", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159420/ca